  "distractor_rules": {
    "roots": [
      "Four choices every time. One is the simple subject. Three are other words from the same stem.",
      "Never use the labels subject, predicate, noun, or verb as choices.",
      "Never put both a noun and the plus that noun in the same choice set.",
      "Tier 1 stems have one noun. Distractors are the verb and small words.",
      "Tier 2 adds an adjective, an object, or a pronoun subject.",
      "Tier 3 uses two nouns, a name versus an object, or a place phrase before the subject.",
      "Vary answer_index so the right tap is not always first.",
      "Kid world only: school, home, food, pets, play, family, weather. No brands. No real names."
    ]
  },
