  "tier_rules": {
    "1": "Short stems of four or five words with one noun. That noun is the subject. Distractors are the verb and small words. Picture the noun.",
    "2": "Grade-level stems with an adjective, an object, or a pronoun subject. Distractors are the extra noun or describing word.",
    "3": "Near misses. Two nouns, a name versus an object, or a place phrase before the subject. The wrong noun is the close distractor."
